              Human-Centered Machine Translation", arXiv:2207.04672, 2022.

The output shown on Halcyon is machine-translated, modified output: Halcyon
translates the source text, then applies its own terminology and name
corrections and rejects translations that change names or numbers. This credit
does not imply endorsement by Meta. NLLB-200 is provided "as is" and "as
available", without representations or warranties of any kind. Meta's model
card describes NLLB-200 as a research model.

Because the licence is non-commercial, NLLB translations are used only while
Halcyon earns no revenue. Before any advertising, paid access or sponsorship,
the NLLB fallback must be removed and its stored translations replaced (see
README.md, "Optional translation and attribution").


Sources and attribution
-----------------------

Every story on Halcyon links to its original publisher or author. Headlines,
excerpts and pictures belong to their publishers and are shown only to point
readers to the source; pictures load directly from the publishers' own servers.
Halcyon's own story summaries are written in Vietnamese and do not replace the
original article. The list of sources Halcyon reads is at
https://hco.news/nguon.html. To ask for a correction or for material to be
removed, use the contact route given on https://hco.news/chinh-sach-rieng-tu.html.


